  "subQuests": [
    {
      "subId": "4111301",
      "subQuestName": "Chat with Mona about the meteorites and scrying",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "411130101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "411130101": {
            "id": "411130101",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Hi Mona! Thanks to you, we've managed to get rid of loads and loads of meteorites!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411130102"
            ]
          },
          "411130102": {
            "id": "411130102",
            "speakerId": 10095,
            "speakerName": "Mona",
            "text": "Ah, good timing! There's something I need you to do.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411130103"
            ]
          },
          "411130103": {
            "id": "411130103",
            "speakerId": 10095,
            "speakerName": "Mona",
            "text": "Remember how I was saying that the meteorites belonged to someone's constellation?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411130104"
            ]
          },
          "411130104": {
            "id": "411130104",
            "speakerId": 10095,
            "speakerName": "Mona",
            "text": "Theoretically, it's not possible for stars that are goodness knows how many light-years away to suddenly turn into meteors and fall out of the sky. But, however paradoxical it may be, this is the reality.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411130105"
            ]
          },
          "411130105": {
            "id": "411130105",
            "speakerId": 10095,
            "speakerName": "Mona",
            "text": "If we want to get to the bottom of this, the best way is to find out whose constellation it was.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411130106"
            ]
          },
          "411130106": {
            "id": "411130106",
            "speakerId": 10095,
            "speakerName": "Mona",
            "text": "Based on what you've told me, it seems that all victims of the meteorites fell into a deep sleep, and all of them dreamed of a snowy mountain.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411130107"
            ]
          },
          "411130107": {
            "id": "411130107",
            "speakerId": 10095,
            "speakerName": "Mona",
            "text": "Now, we may not know which mountain this was — but we can safely assume that it's not Dragonspine. Otherwise, someone would have recognized it, right?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411130108"
            ]
          },
          "411130108": {
            "id": "411130108",
            "speakerId": 10095,
            "speakerName": "Mona",
            "text": "Did everyone definitely have the same dream? And where exactly were they in the dream? These are the questions that we need answers to.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411130109"
            ]
          },
          "411130109": {
            "id": "411130109",
            "speakerId": 10095,
            "speakerName": "Mona",
            "text": "I need you to find out more details about the sleepers' dreams. The more information we have, the closer we can get to the truth.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411130110"
            ]
          },
          "411130110": {
            "id": "411130110",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Seems we should head somewhere with lots of people around.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411130111"
            ]
          },
          "411130111": {
            "id": "411130111",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "That way, we should be able to find more victims to question.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411130112"
            ]
          },
          "411130112": {
            "id": "411130112",
            "speakerId": 10095,
            "speakerName": "Mona",
            "text": "I need to stay in an undisturbed environment. So, I will leave the investigating to you.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411130113"
            ]
          },
          "411130113": {
            "id": "411130113",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Is there anywhere that we haven't been to yet?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411130114"
            ]
          },
          "411130114": {
            "id": "411130114",
            "speakerId": 10012,
            "speakerName": "Oz",
            "text": "There is <color=#00E1FFFF>Qingce Village</color>, in Liyue... Although, it does not usually match your suggestion of \"somewhere with lots of people around.\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411130115"
            ]
          },
          "411130115": {
            "id": "411130115",
            "speakerId": 10012,
            "speakerName": "Oz",
            "text": "That said, I suspect that the Millelith will have turned that area into a site where victims can receive medical attention, much as they did at Wangshu Inn."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "4111318",
      "subQuestName": "Go to Qingce Village",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "411131801"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "411131801": {
            "id": "411131801",
            "speakerId": 30026,
            "speakerName": "Gao the Sixth",
            "text": "Thanks to you, I didn't starve to death in my sleep!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "4111302",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to the Millelith",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "411130201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "411130201": {
            "id": "411130201",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Hello, we're from the Adventurers' Guild. Can you tell us if Qingce Village has been affected by the meteorite strike?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411130202"
            ]
          },
          "411130202": {
            "id": "411130202",
            "speakerId": 30014,
            "speakerName": "Jinglun",
            "text": "Adventurers! Perfect! I was beginning to despair at the lack of helpers.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411130203"
            ]
          },
          "411130203": {
            "id": "411130203",
            "speakerId": 30014,
            "speakerName": "Jinglun",
            "text": "These meteorite strikes have been going on for days now. Don't even get me started on how much trouble it's caused...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411130204"
            ]
          },
          "411130204": {
            "id": "411130204",
            "speakerId": 30014,
            "speakerName": "Jinglun",
            "text": "If one lands in a <color=#00E1FFFF>field</color>, no one dares to go and harvest the crops, and if one lands <color=#00E1FFFF>at the entrance</color>, access is a complete nightmare.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411130205"
            ]
          },
          "411130205": {
            "id": "411130205",
            "speakerId": 30014,
            "speakerName": "Jinglun",
            "text": "Do you have any ideas on how to safely dispose of them? They're just making everything impossible!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411130206"
            ]
          },
          "411130206": {
            "id": "411130206",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "I take it Qingce Village has been affected, then.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "411130207"
            ]
          },
          "411130207": {
            "id": "411130207",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Guess we'd better help this guy out."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "4111303",
      "subQuestName": "Dispose of the meteorites in the fields",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "411130301"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "411130301": {
            "id": "411130301",
            "speakerId": 30014,
            "speakerName": "Jinglun",
            "text": "I really hope you can help us deal with the meteorites."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "4111304",
